OL,3,GNEWSABBC Northern Ireland Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards 2026 winners revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grieving mother who turned the loss
OL,7,Fof her 11-year-old daughter into a
OL,8,Fcampaign for stronger school bus safety
OL,9,Fmeasures is among numerous nominees
OL,10,Fgoing the extra mile to improve the
OL,11,Flives of people in their communities.
OL,13,FThe winners were announced live on BBC
OL,14,FRadio Ulster on Vinny & Cate's Friday
OL,15,Fmorning show.
OL,17,FFinalists were selected by a panel of
OL,18,Fjudges in eight different categories.
